dsh-kitt-voice — acknowledgements

This plugin was designed after studying the existing voice plugins for the
DeepSeek Harness. Where their approach informed this one, credit is due:

- dsh-voice-mode (MIT) — qishuilalala
  https://github.com/qishuilalala/dsh-voice-mode
  Reference for the composer slot layout, the state machine of a voice turn
  and the echo-pause behaviour while the reply is being read aloud.

- dsh-ears (MIT) — WizisCool
  https://github.com/WizisCool/dsh-ears
  Reference for the speech-to-text provider layout (Groq Whisper and local
  whisper.cpp).

- dsh-talk (Apache-2.0) — PerryLink
  https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-talk
  Reference for pointing the reader at user-supplied Piper voice models.

- dsh-espanol (MIT)
